oughly flat on Q4.","quote":"Q1 FY27 revenues stood at INR14,768 million, up 22% year-on-year and broadly stable sequentially over good Q4.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"EBITDA rose 37% to Rs 3,389 million with margin up about 256 bps to 22.9%.","quote":"EBITDA was INR3,389 million, up 37% year-on-year at a margin of 22.9%, an expansion of around 256 basis points.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Complex generics rose to 50% of finished dosages from about 39% a year ago.","quote":"Complex generics, which were around 39% of our finished dosages a year ago are now 50%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"EBITDA margin fell 99 bps quarter on quarter as R&D spending stepped up.","quote":"with focused step-up investments in complex generics R&D for future growth. Q-o-Q EBITDA has marginally declined by 99 basis points.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The peptide CDMO business had negative EBITDA this quarter.","quote":"So these are some of the reasons why we have a negative EBITDA for this quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Europe was soft sequentially as supply was held back over pricing and cost pressures.","quote":"So it's primarily been a mix of intentional hold of supply due to pricing and costing pressures.",