:"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Raw material pressures are high, but the shift in product mix is helping.","quote":"Shashank, the RM pressures are quite high. There's a lot of challenges we are facing. But like you said, the mix is really helping us.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Opening US inventory kept Q1 gross margin insulated from cost pressures, in line with Q4.","quote":"our opening inventory levels in the U.S.A helped to ensure that Q1 FY27 gross margins remain largely insulated from these pressures broadly in line with Q4 FY26.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The move to complex generics is supporting margins and is expected to continue.","quote":"Move towards more complex generics is helping us. And we have every reason to believe that it will continue.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"Q1 capex was Rs 890 million against Rs 1,000 million in Q4.","quote":"Capex spent on Q1 FY27 is INR890 million compared to INR1,000 million in Q4 FY26.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The India peptide plan starts with about Rs 100 crore for intermediates and Rs 200 crore for API.","quote":"our initial estimates suggest roughly about INR100 crores numbers on the intermediate side, and if you take it forward to the API side, we are starting with INR200 crores of investment plan.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The new Genome Valley facility adds about 40% to formulation capacity.","quote":"We scale up our new Genome Valley facility, which adds about 40% to our formulation capacity.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Genome Valley utilisation is very low now and should cross 50% by year end.","quote":"And Yashika on the second question onGLS, currently, the utilization levels are very low. By the year-end, we are expecting it will cross 50%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":14.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The US GPI facility runs at about 70% utilisation with room to grow.","quote":"We are currently at around 70% capacity utilization. And we have quite a large leeway to go ahead.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":16.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Net debt to EBITDA is 0.07x, making the company practically debt free.","quote":"Our net debt to EBITDA is now almost nothing, 0.07x. So for all practical purposes, we are debt free,","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Net debt fell to Rs 1,012 million from Rs 4,021 million at FY26 end.","quote":"Net debt stands at INR1,012 million in Q1 FY27 from INR4,021 million at FY26 close.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRANULES_27072026120801_NSEBSE27072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Operating cash flow was Rs 3,874 million against Rs 1,003 million in Q4.","quote":"O